{"conversation_id":"70d60043-5d19-471f-bd7b-fdf798f4477e","status":"SUCCESS","response":"I will wait for the solo DHT smoke test background task to finish.\nI will wait for the JVM load check background task to complete.\nI will wait for the `bb probe:jolt-udp-failures` verification background task to complete.\nThe J7 fix round addressing all review findings P1 and P2x3 from [collab/jolt/j7-review.findings.md](file:///home/sto/ci/dw-j7/collab/jolt/j7-review.findings.md) is complete.\n\n### Summary of Fixes\n\n1. **P2 (close-on-exec! and IPV6_V6ONLY check)** — [src/jolt/dao/stream/udp.jolt](file:///home/sto/ci/dw-j7/src/jolt/dao/stream/udp.jolt#L173-L191)\n   - Checked the boolean result of `native/close-on-exec!`: on `false`, closes the acquired descriptor and deposits `:dao.stream.datagram/bind-failed` with `\"close-on-exec! failed\"`.\n   - Checked `[r-v6 err-v6]` from `IPV6_V6ONLY` `native/set-int-option!`: on failure `(neg? r-v6)`, closes the descriptor and deposits `bind-failed` with `(str \"IPV6_V6ONLY failed: errno \" err-v6)`.\n\n2. **P2 (immediate descriptor and buffer cleanup)** — [src/jolt/dao/stream/udp.jolt](file:///home/sto/ci/dw-j7/src/jolt/dao/stream/udp.jolt#L168-L298)\n   - Established `close-fd!` immediately after `c-socket` descriptor acquisition; executes all setup operations in `try ... (catch Throwable t (close-fd!) (failed-seam deposit identity (or (ex-message t) (str t))))` ensuring descriptors and buffers are released on throw and `bind-failed` is reported preserving the original reason.\n   - Enforced nested `try ... finally` buffer ownership discipline immediately upon allocation in `send-fn` (`buf` freed if `make-sockaddr` throws) and `step-fn` (`buf` freed if `alloc-sockaddr` throws). Wrapped `parse-literal-host` in `try ... catch`.\n\n3. **P2 (receive diagnostics, fatal closure, and loop control)** — [src/jolt/dao/stream/udp.jolt](file:///home/sto/ci/dw-j7/src/jolt/dao/stream/udp.jolt#L236-L287)\n   - Retained instance-owned `diagnostics` atom on every seam instance, accessible via `:diagnostics`, `:diagnostic`, and `dao.stream.udp/diagnostics`.\n   - **Fatal descriptor errors** (such as Linux `ENOTSOCK` 88, `EBADF` 9): recorded in diagnostics with errno and closed once via `close-fn` (closing fd, canceling/forgetting poller, depositing `closed` event, and setting `@closed? true`); turn terminates immediately with no retries inside the turn. Subsequent owner calls to `step!` return `{:progressed? false}` without making syscalls.\n   - **Interruption** (`EINTR` 4): remains recoverable; records diagnostic with errno 4, does not close descriptor, does not retry inside the turn, and leaves the descriptor open and functional for subsequent turns.\n   - **Would-block** (`EAGAIN` 11, `ENOBUFS` 105): stays silent, does not record error diagnostics, and terminates the turn.\n\n4. **P1 (applicability reconciliation and failure injection probe)** — [test/resources/yin/repl/jolt-applicability.edn](file:///home/sto/ci/dw-j7/test/resources/yin/repl/jolt-applicability.edn#L6-L29), [src/dev/jolt_j2_lane.clj](file:///home/sto/ci/dw-j7/src/dev/jolt_j2_lane.clj#L127-L218), [bb.edn](file:///home/sto/ci/dw-j7/bb.edn#L74-L78), [src/dev/jolt_udp_failures_probe.clj](file:///home/sto/ci/dw-j7/src/dev/jolt_udp_failures_probe.clj)\n   - Reconciled 11 test exclusions in `jolt-applicability.edn` and 14 test namespace exclusions in `jolt_j2_lane.clj` to cite the landed state (Slices 1 and 2 landed) and specify why they remain open per design §§6–7 (process roles, multi-node network fixtures, Transit board dependencies, cross-host interop). Full J7 gate completion is **not** claimed and remains open.\n   - Added `bb probe:jolt-udp-failures` with 68 failure-injection regression assertions covering setup failures, throws, buffer cleanup, fatal seam closure, recoverable EINTR, silent would-block, and complete production writer/seam contracts.\n\n---\n\n### Acceptance Evidence\n\nEvidence recorded in [collab/jolt/j7-fix.findings.md](file:///home/sto/ci/dw-j7/collab/jolt/j7-fix.findings.md):\n\n| Check | Command | Result |\n|---|---|---|\n| Retained UDP probe | `bb probe:jolt-udp` | **37/37 passed**, 0 failed, 3 records (exit 0) |\n| Failure injection probe | `bb probe:jolt-udp-failures` | **68/68 passed**, 0 failed (exit 0) |\n| Solo DHT shell smoke | `printf '(+ 1 2)\\n' \\| \"$JOLT_HOME/bin/jolt\" -Srepro -M:jolt:jolt-yin-repl --no-state --index-store dht:/tmp/...` | Booted, solo message, evaluated `(+ 1 2) =\u003e 3`, durable blobs published (exit 0) |\n| Claimed JVM suites | `clojure -M:test -n dao.stream.udp-test -n dao.stream.udp-raw-test -n dao.stream.datagram-test` | **37 tests, 185 assertions, 0 failures, 0 errors** (exit 0) |\n| JVM load | `clojure -M -e \"(require 'yin.shell.dht 'yin.repl) (println :jvm-load-ok)\"` | `:jvm-load-ok` (exit 0) |\n\n---\n\n### Commits on `fix/j7-udp-dht`\n\n- `d6c76f5f` `fix(udp): check close-on-exec! and IPV6_V6ONLY results on native UDP bind (P2)`\n- `8f158fc5` `fix(udp): establish immediate native buffer and descriptor cleanup on UDP paths (P2)`\n- `7d9346de` `fix(udp): retain receive diagnostics and close seam once on fatal descriptor errors (P2)`\n- `a7357c88` `test(jolt): reconcile J7 applicability and add failure-injection probe (P1)`\n- `336bc526` `docs(collab): J7 fix round findings and acceptance evidence`\n","duration_seconds":1428.000189293,"num_turns":1,"usage":{"input_tokens":452803,"output_tokens":95641,"thinking_tokens":56030,"cache_read_tokens":18634165,"total_tokens":548444}}
